WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.036
RUSSIA'S PROPAGANDA
MACHINE IS MOVING INTO HIGH

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:06.005
GEAR AS THE WAR IN UKRAINE
NEARS ITS FIRST ANNIVERSARY.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.741
VLADIMIR PUTIN'S SHAMELESS
SUPPORTER --

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:11.711
SUPPORTERS IS MAKING A MOCKERY
OF WEAPON.

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:15.181
NOT EVERYONE'S BUYING IT.
CNN'S NICK ROBERTSON REPORTS.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:21.121
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
TO THE LET'S CATS, BATTLES

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:24.157
ABRAMS, HE SAYS.
THE RUSSIAN STATE MEDIA ANCHOR

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:28.027
POINTS TO A HUGE GRAPHIC,
ALLEGING FLOORS IN THE NATO

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:31.331
THANKS.
HIS PURPOSEFUL PROPAGANDA

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:35.101
PLAYING DOWN RISK THE RUSSIAN
TROOPS IN UKRAINE.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:40.340
DOES SEEM TO BE WORKING.
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.243
&gt;&gt; SENDING TANKS IS GONNA BE
BAD FOR THE AMERICANS OF

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.012
GERMANS SHE SAID.
&gt;&gt; WE'RE GOING TO WIN

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:50.116
REGARDLESS, SERGEI TELLS US.
IT JUST ENLARGING THE CONFLICT.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.052
IF WE PULL OUT, THE WEST WILL
PUT MORE PRESSURE ON US.

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:58.091
&gt;&gt; BUT NOT EVERYONE BUYS THIS
DAY TV HYPE.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:04.030
PUTIN HAS KILLED OFF
INDEPENDENT MEDIA BUT NOT

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.166
INDEPENDENCE OF MIND.
THIS YOUNG --

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:10.003
STUDENT TELLS THE TEAM THAT THE
FRONT WAS DRAFTED AND DEPLOYED

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.973
BUT IT HAS NOW DISAPPEARED.
AND FOR PEACE, SHE SAYS, IT'S

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.109
VERY SAD.
PEOPLE ARE DYING AMONG THE

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:19.312
VERGE OF TEARS.
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:22.115
I DON'T KNOW IF IT'S TRUE OR
NOT OR WHAT'S GOING ON IN THIS

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:24.217
WAR.
THIS LADY TELLS US.

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:27.320
BUT I DO KNOW PEOPLE HAVE BEEN
KILLED.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:33.993
SOME OF THEM, OUR FRIENDS AND
ALL IN MOTIONS THE KREMLIN

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:34.861
LIKES THE PREDAWN.
--

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:38.031
&gt;&gt; AROUND THE CAPITAL, AIR
DEFENSE SYSTEMS HAVE BEEN

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:41.701
LOCKED IN AN AIR GOVERNMENT
BUILDING THE LESS THAN SUBTLE.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:53.580
--
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:01:53.580 --> 00:02:00.286
IN MORE PRIMETIME, PUTIN'S
PROPAGANDA THE POP-UP SHOPS

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:04.090
UPON FOR THE AUDIENCE.
TELLS THEM THE GERMAN LEOPARD 2

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:12.398
TANKS WILL BURN VERY NICELY.
ANOTHER PUTIN ALKALI, HE'S THE

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:16.469
INSANELY POPULAR VOLODYMYR --
ASKED THE AUDIENCE, AFTER ALL

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.472
OF THIS, IS IN BERLIN A LAWFUL
TARGET?

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:23.176
&gt;&gt; SUCH IS THE STITCH UP IN
RUSSIAN MEDIA.

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:27.280
PUTIN IS ABLE TO SPEND ALMOST
ANY MESSAGE HE WANTS.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:34.320
HIS TV PUPPETS, SERVE FAST AND
CLEARS IN EQUAL MEASURE.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.155
BUT EVEN THAT IS NOT GOING DOWN
SO WELL WITH SOME.

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:42.095
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
&gt;&gt; EVERYONE IS LISTENING TO --

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:46.232
OPINION, SHE SAID, BUT IT WOULD
BE GOOD IF THE EXPERT STARTED

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:50.036
EXPRESSING THEIR REAL OPINIONS
INSTEAD OF OBEYING ORDERS FROM

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:52.272
PUTIN.
WHAT'S REAL IS ANYONE'S GUESS.

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:56.175
AND, FOR SOME, THAT MEANS
TUNING OUT.

00:02:56.175 --> 00:03:00.013
THIS LADY TELLS US, SHE DOESN'T
KNOW ABOUT THE TANKS WHEN WE

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:02.815
ASK HER OPINION.
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:06.319
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: I THINK THAT
THIS IS A POLITICAL WAR.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:09.188
I'M NOT A WAR FOR THE PEOPLE,
THIS LADY TELLS THE TEAM.

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:12.058
WHAT ARE WE SUPPOSED TO DO, SHE
SAYS?

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:18.097
OUR OPINIONS MEAN DIDDLY-SQUAT.
&gt;&gt; INCREASINGLY ISOLATED FROM

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.167
OUTSIDE VIEWS AND UNDER THREAT
OF HARSH RETRIBUTION IF THEY

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:23.403
DISSENT, RUSSIANS ARE STUCK IN
A RUT.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:27.040
IN A WAR THAT THEY DON'T WANT
WITH A LEADER THEY CAN'T

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:30.042
REMOVE.
AND, THE THREAT OF POTENTIAL

00:03:30.042 --> 00:03:33.212
RECRUITMENT AROUND THE CORNER.
THEY ARE DOING WHAT RUSSIANS

00:03:33.212 --> 00:03:36.215
HAVE HISTORICALLY DONE IN THE
FACE OF ADVERSITY.

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:41.588
FOCUSING ON THEIR OWN SURVIVAL.
NIC ROBERTSON, CNN, LONDON.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:07.046
ABSOLUTELY, IT'S A RACE AGAINST
TIMES AND.

00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:09.515
NO TO GETTING THOSE TEAMS TO
THE FRONTLINE.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:11.918
THERE'S A FEW LOGISTICAL
ISSUES.

00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:14.120
THESE THINGS ARE SPREAD UP OVER
A DOZEN COUNTRIES.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.090
GERMANY HAS TO GIVE
PRE-AUTHORIZATION.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.626
THEY ARE THE MANUFACTURERS OF
THE LEOPARD 2 TANKS.

00:04:20.626 --> 00:04:23.563
THEY HAVE TO GIVE PROPER AS A
SHUNT EVERY COUNTRY TO DEPLOY

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:25.598
THOSE TANKS.
THEY HAVE TO PROVIDE TRAINING

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.700
THAT SUPPOSED TO START AS SOON
AS POSSIBLE FOR UKRAINIAN

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.570
SOLDIERS IN GERMANY.
THEN THERE'S THE QUESTION OF

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.871
COMPENSATION.
HOW WILL NATO, HOW WILL GERMANY

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:34.807
PAY FOR THESE TANKS ARE
COMPENSATE THE COUNTRIES THAT

00:04:34.807 --> 00:04:38.644
GAVE THESE TANKS TO UKRAINE.
ALL OF THOSE LOGISTICS, AGAIN,

00:04:38.644 --> 00:04:41.547
BEING DEALT WITH IN BERLIN.
TAKE A LISTEN TO HOW UKRAINE'S

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:45.752
DEFENSE MINISTER RESPONDED WHEN
ONE REPORTER ASKED, HOW QUICKLY

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:48.788
ARE WE GOING TO SEE THESE TANKS
ON THE BATTLEFIELD?

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:52.692
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU GET THE TANKS TO
UKRAINE IN TIME?

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:55.595
&gt;&gt; I PROBABLY WILL.
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG WILL IT TAKE TO GET

00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:57.797
THERE?
&gt;&gt; THE END OF THE FIRST QUARTER

00:04:57.797 --> 00:05:01.601
OF THE YEAR.
THAT'S WHAT WE ARE GOING TO DO.

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:03.603
&gt;&gt; HOW MANY MONTHS?
TO?

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:04.637
3?
FOR?

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:07.707
&gt;&gt; I JUST SAID, AT THE END OF
MARCH, I THINK.

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:11.677
&gt;&gt; NOW, THE REASON FOR THIS
RUSH, THE REASON FOR THIS PUSH

00:05:11.677 --> 00:05:15.214
IS THIS COUNTEROFFENSIVE AS THE
WEATHER GETS WARMER.

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:18.651
THERE'S AN EXPECTATION THAT
RUSSIAN FORCES WILL PICK UP THE

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:21.788
TEMPO OF THE WAR, TRY TO ATTACK
UKRAINIAN FORCES.

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:24.657
UKRAINE, OF COURSE, FOR ITS
PART, WANTS TO PUSH THROUGH ITS

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:26.859
EAST TANKS AS AN IRON FIST THAT
WILL ALLOW THEM TO --

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:34.333
OF CAUTION HERE, COME IN TOTAL,
WE JUST HAVE OVER 100 TANKS

00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:37.403
THAT HAVE BEEN PROMISED AMONG
THEM ARE THOSE 30 ABRAMS, 31

00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:40.573
ABRAMS TO BE EXACT, TANKS FROM
THE UNITED STATES.

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:43.309
THOSE COULD TAKE OVER A YEAR
BEFORE THEY ACTUALLY ARRIVE IN

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:45.378
UKRAINE.
AS YOU HEARD, THE LEOPARD TANKS

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:47.380
