00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:51.717
HE WAS ASKING FOR OVER 300
TANKS.

00:05:51.717 --> 00:05:55.488
AND AS I SAID, JUST OVER 100
GOING INTO UKRAINE.

00:05:55.488 --> 00:06:00.359
BUT REALLY, WHAT IT'S ABOUT IS
THE BIGGEST PICTURE HERE, KIM,

00:06:00.359 --> 00:06:01.928
THIS IS ABOUT THE POLITICAL
WILL.

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:04.397
SOMETHING THAT WAS UNIMAGINABLE
A YEAR AGO.

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:07.433
SO, FOR KYIV, THEY'RE HOPING
THAT THIS OPENS THE DOOR A

00:06:07.433 --> 00:06:11.471
